{"/builds/136-alistar-support-soporte": {"id": 136, "contentful_id": "01d1EouZUWhoIJaDJEAE26", "locale": "es-ES", "champion_contentful_id": "2ArZRIpc4X8eZmAZMwnVOs", "champion_id": 45, "roles": ["support"], "title": "Build de ALISTAR en Wild Rift Rol soporte", "short_title": "Soporte", "summary": null, "patch": null, "tier": null, "status": "active", "disabled_at": null, "description": null, "early_game": null, "mid_game": null, "late_game": null, "first_ability_order": ["1", "4", "6", "7"], "second_ability_order": ["2", "8", "10", "11"], "third_ability_order": ["3", "12", "14", "15"], "ultimate_ability_order": ["5", "9", "13"], "sys_updated_at": "2026-07-09T04:00:45.000000Z", "cache_version": 2, "content_hash": "fc925ce41bd54f22c9e047e726a2d80f94bf05c4", "items_version": 131, "runes_version": 131, "spells_version": 131, "created_at": "2026-05-19T12:08:36.000000Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T03:13:23.000000Z", "items": [{"id": 72, "name": "Escudo reliquia", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/28znXnrguMfzPNYjH55ROu/6048ce9ae3b8e8b3d474438ff8264c38/reliquia_wasbi_hanu_bbwr.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 100, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 500, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Bot\u00edn de guerra: Mientras est\u00e9s cerca de un campe\u00f3n aliado, los ataques consumen una carga para ejecutar a los s\u00fabditos que tengan menos de 50% (30% a distancia) de su vida m\u00e1xima. Al matar a un s\u00fabdito, recibes un 120% del oro, el aliado m\u00e1s cercano recibe un 100% del oro y te curas vida. Un 58% del oro conseguido de este modo cuenta de cara a tu misi\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Estos efectos se recargan cada 20 segundos (3 cargas como m\u00e1ximo).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Adem\u00e1s, conseguir\u00e1s un 50% menos de oro al matar s\u00fabditos y monstruos, un 100% de oro adicional de los s\u00fabditos cercanos a los que no maten tus aliados y 1 de oro adicional cada 3 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Misi\u00f3n: Gana 500 de oro con este objeto para que se transforme en Broquel de Targon.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 1, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 144, "name": "BOTAS BLINDADAS", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/7x1MJFBn2qvbAUJ34T1Gbd/6f75907ee42e4ed5e91f27459163d8d9/Plated_Steelcaps.png", "boots": true, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 150, "armor": 25, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 45, "cost": 1200, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Bloque:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Los ataques b\u00e1sicos de los campeones te infligen un 10% menos de da\u00f1o.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 2, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 32, "name": "Trampa para yordles", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/22AOd0ayUYLXuV7QbT0mmj/999b7316fcbc409ea70a144015495166/yordles.webp", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 15, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 350, "armor": 40, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 2500, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Tras aplicar efectos de control de adversario que desplazan al enemigo, otorga un 30 % de velocidad de movimiento durante 3 s y marca al objetivo, lo que reduce su armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica en 5-12 durante 5 s. Si el enemigo muere durante el efecto de la marca, t\u00fa y los aliados cercanos obten\u00e9is 200-300 de oro adicional en total. El oro adicional solo se puede obtener una vez cada 10 s.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 3, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 1109, "name": "BOTAS BLINDADAS [ NIVEL 3 ]", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/1ncwdstWMJP2u8CFJDp1xK/3445a70f6cbf415611704f38f8c7f14b/vbnghhfsdf.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": true, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 150, "armor": 35, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 2200, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Bloquear: Los ataques b\u00e1sicos de los campeones te infligen un 10% menos de da\u00f1o.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resistencia Noxiana: Recibir da\u00f1o f\u00edsico de campeones otorga un escudo f\u00edsico equivalente a 20 - 140 (seg\u00fan el nivel) + 5% de tu salud m\u00e1xima. (Enfriamiento de 12 segundos)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 4, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 1097, "name": "Placa de piedra de g\u00e1rgola", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/7jjLME62D1un1nR9U391vm/993c66acd4ab85244f3511dbc489a98a/protector_hanu.jpg", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 10, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 200, "armor": 45, "magic_resistance": 45, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 2900, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Placa de piedra (activa): Obt\u00e9n un escudo equivalente a 100 + 90% de salud adicional que se disipa r\u00e1pidamente en 2,5 segundos. (Tiempo de reutilizaci\u00f3n: 60 segundos)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 5, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 44, "name": "CORAZA DEL MUERTO", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/7w0M6EjV30a04fPfQebO1p/0f3474a62faae06e5d0eb3850675c65e/corazon_hanu.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 350, "armor": 70, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 5, "cost": 2800, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Impulso:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Moverse genera Impulso, lo que otorga hasta 40 de velocidad de movimiento con 100 acumulaciones. Los ataques eliminan todo el Impulso. Las acumulaciones decrecen si la movilidad se ve reducida.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpe aplastante:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Los ataques infligen hasta 100 de da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico adicional en funci\u00f3n del Impulso eliminado. Los ataques cuerpo a cuerpo con el m\u00e1ximo de Impulso ralentizan un 75% durante 1 segundo.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 6, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 45, "name": "FUERZA DE LA NATURALEZA", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3kbh5D2l70s0QcthgUPY45/f391753321b169408795af4e60625ab5/natu_hanu.webp", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 350, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 60, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 5, "cost": 2750, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Absorber", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ": Recibir da\u00f1o de habilidades otorga 6 de velocidad de movimiento y 6 de resistencia m\u00e1gica durante 5 segundos. Este efecto se acumula hasta 5 veces, para conseguir un m\u00e1ximo de 30 de velocidad de movimiento y 30 de resistencia m\u00e1gica.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada habilidad \u00fanica otorga 1 acumulaci\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 6, "group": "optional", "condition": "Vs Da\u00f1o M\u00e1gico", "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 64, "name": "Coraza dual purp\u00farea", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2Sisx5AzmpOUHeg0YjhsCL/b810fad49f2f29658b8d44a9604c5e82/purpura_hanu.jpg", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 60, "magic_resistance": 60, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 3200, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": " ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resistencia", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ": Otorga acumulaciones de Resistencia cada 1 segundo mientras est\u00e9s en combate  contra campeones enemigos (m\u00e1ximo de 5 acumulaciones).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, otorga un 30% de tama\u00f1o, un 20% de tenacidad, un 30% de armadura y un 30% de resistencia m\u00e1gica hasta que dejes de combatir contra campeones.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 7, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 143, "name": "BOTAS DE MERCURIO", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/1Plkkvi4FHBQwGsFR35oSe/88d98b9e09db7eb0e20bfdc203ce4a13/Botas_de_Mercurio_objeto.png", "boots": true, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 150, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 25, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 45, "cost": 1200, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Tenacidad:  ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "30", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "%", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 7, "group": "boots", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": n