nu.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 105, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 40, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 3000, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Anular: ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga un escudo de hechizos que bloquea la siguiente habilidad enemiga (30 s de enfriamiento).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\n", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 7, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}], "optionalItems": [], "runes": {"catalog": {"keystones": [{"id": 51, "name": "Electrocutar", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3VeCp8BTJgS0ZJsJYnfn1l/1da19c1f4bcc08023deaee5ad57dc901/electrocutar_hanu.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n con 3 ataques o habilidades diferentes es un margen de 3 segundos hace que inflijas da\u00f1o adaptable adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\nDa\u00f1o: 40-194 (por nivel) +35% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 20% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico).\nEnfriamiento: 20-13 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 50, "name": "COSECHA OSCURA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/206PWdBKdbq3sYbz5rWhqL/1083fb5bae50c0689715d6544f9f780a/dark-harvest.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Realizar da\u00f1o a campeones enemigo con menos del 50% te permite cosechar su alma, infligiendo da\u00f1o adaptable y aumentando el da\u00f1o de la runa en 10. ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "20 segundos de enfriamiento por campe\u00f3n \u00fanico, que se reduce en un segundo por participar en una eliminaci\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 49, "name": "FORTALECIMIENTO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4d5eghiJBOy4xnH2qraRXN/9767cc3edf8c9d73961d77bdf6940a84/pfortalecimiento_hanu_png.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo, amplificaci\u00f3n del da\u00f1o", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con 3 ataques consecutivos inflige da\u00f1o adaptable adicional y lo deja vulnerable, lo que ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "potencia el da\u00f1o que infliges un 8 % hasta que abandonas el combate con campeones ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Mientras sea vulnerable, tus ataques infligen da\u00f1o verdadero adicional al objetivo. Cuando el objetivo sale del estado vulnerable, vulnerabilidad entra en enfriamiento y no se puede aplicar a ning\u00fan enemigo durante 6 segundos.\n\nDa\u00f1o adaptable: 40-180 (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o verdadero: 6-20 (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 48, "name": "COMP\u00c1S LETAL", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3VjyOLza6ankvBKcZzGoJN/c16331dbb6922c9e4d6fbce1f91e0e7d/compas_letal_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Velocidad de ataque", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Obtienes velocidad de ataque acumulable al atacar a campeones enemigos. Se acumula hasta 6 veces. Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes alcance adicional y puedes superar el l\u00edmite de velocidad de ataque.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "unordered-list", "content": [{"nodeType": "list-item", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada acumulaci\u00f3n aumenta la velocidad de ataque un 8-16 % (cuerpo a cuerpo) o un 3-12 % (a distancia) durante 6 s.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, {"nodeType": "list-item", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes 50 (cuerpo a cuerpo) o 75 (a distancia) de alcance de ataque.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}]}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 3, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 52, "name": "PIES VELOCES", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4bquJRMlzSfhjmgsH9Ipig/07fe958018fa96805a09fd91840ebc31/pies_veloces_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Movilidad, curaci\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Moverse, atacar y utilizar habilidades genera acumulaciones de energ\u00eda. A las 100 acumulaciones, tu siguiente ataque te cura, te otorga velocidad de movimiento adicional y restaura man\u00e1 o energ\u00eda si atacas a un campe\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n: 15-85 (por nivel) + 30% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 30% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico) ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Mejora la velocidad de movimiento: 20% durante 1 segundo", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al atacar a un campe\u00f3n, restaura un 8% del man\u00e1 o un 8% de la energ\u00eda que te falte.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n: Cuerpo a cuerpo: 35% | A distancia: 15% al atacar a s\u00fabdito o monstruos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 4, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 47, "name": "CONQUISTADOR", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6ZqBIEsBgpDsZrvw2jbrvz/0673ee14b9321dba3b2878ee9e277a81/conqueror_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Acumula da\u00f1o y succi\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n con ataques o habildiades diferentes otorga acumulaciones de fuerza adaptable. Se acumula hasta 6 veces. Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes omnisucci\u00f3n adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada acumulaci\u00f3n otorga: 2- 6 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 3-9 de poder de habilidad adicional durante 6 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "La mejora del m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones otorga un 8% (cuerpo a cuerpo) o un 5% (a distancia) de omnisucci\u00f3n adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 5, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 53, "name": "Garras del inmortal", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5s9rlUzcw1ienCCBvgphzV/e2885baf394a5830eb57e8385dbe3c1c/desgarrador_hanu.png", "short_description": "Control, ofensiva", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada 3 segundos que pases en combate, se potenciar\u00e1 tu siguiente ataque contra un campe\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\n", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico adicional:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 2 % de la vida m\u00e1xima.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n otorgada:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 2,5 % de la vida m\u00e1xima.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Vida m\u00e1xima obtenida por tiempo: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "10.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 6, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 3, "name": "GUARDI\u00c1N", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5RCknJe0sQfxfQyIhoJCMJ/85c3c532319589d9e0b387f1ae4395ca/guardian.webp", "short_description": "Protecci\u00f3n, escudo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Proteges a los aliados que se encuentren a 350 unidades de ti y a los aliados que sean objetivo de tus habilidades durante 2,5 segundos.", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Si durante este tiempo tu aliado o t\u00fa recib\u00eds m\u00e1s que una peque\u00f1a cantidad de da\u00f1o, ambos obten\u00e9is un escudo durante ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "2 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Escudo:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 45-180 + 5% de la vida adicional + 15% del poder de habilidad\n", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 40-20 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resumen:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Proteges a aliados cercanos o afectados por tus habilidades, y si reciben da\u00f1o, ambos obten\u00e9is un escudo.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 7, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 46, "name": "AERY", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/vuKrT72b1RPH90CC6ZmF9/82aabd1378f97ee6fe2cc954070d68b0/aery_hanu.png", "short_description": "Desgaste, protecci\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Tus ataques y habilidades env\u00edan a Aery a un objetivo para da\u00f1ar a los enemigos u otorgar un escudo a los aliados.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o: 15-70 (por nivel) + 20% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 10% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Escudo: 30-140 (por nivel) + 40% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 20% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "No se puede enviar Aery de nuevo hasta que vuelva a ti.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 8, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 45, "name": "COMETA ARCANO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/fDZC5cahgbxovDlJKc8vv/3f95eb5505b95e3f638e0e4d9b892a14/cometa_hanu_bbwr.png", "short_description": "Hostigar desde lejos", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infligir da\u00f1o con una habilidad a un campe\u00f3n proyecta un cometa hacia su ubicaci\u00f3n. Cuando un cometa golpea a un campe\u00f3n enemigo, aumenta el da\u00f1o del siguiente. ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 16-8 segundos (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 9, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 44, "name": "IRRUPCI\u00d3N DE FASE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5BwiJwxAuC4xTkDGeE5bui/2047286bea46afe1f871f7a3e7625078/324314341234123_hanu_wr_bb.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Movilidad, velocidad de habilidades", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Utilizar 3 ataques b\u00e1sicos o habilidades contra un campe\u00f3n enemigo en 4 segundos otorga velocidad de habilidades y velocidad de movimiento. Adem\u00e1s, reduce el enfriamiento restante de  las habilidades b\u00e1sicas en un 20%.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Duraci\u00f3n: 3 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Velocidad de movimiento: Cuerpo a cuerpo : 40%-60% (por nivel) | A distancia: 30%-50% (por nivel) \nVelocidad de habilidades: 25.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 12 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 10, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 43, "name": "PRIMER GOLPE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/533TP9AHOp0BMekk0dcY5Q/0b782a3e2a6e09a6031761a4f3ea493d/8369.png", "short_description": "Oro y da\u00f1o adicionales", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infligir da\u00f1o a un campe\u00f3n enemigo durante los primeros 0,25 segundos despu\u00e9s de entrar en combate contra el te otorga 5 de oro y el efecto de primer golpe durante 3 segundos, lo que te permite infligirle un 7% de da\u00f1o verdadero adiciona. Cuando el efecto desaparece, obtienes oro seg\u00fan el da\u00f1o adicional infligido durante la duraci\u00f3n del mismo. \nOro adicional: 100% (cuerpo a cuerpo)/85 % (a distancia) del da\u00f1o adicional\n", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 20-13 (dependiendo del nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 11, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 5, "name": "MEJORA GLACIAL", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/38NzEB19PT7D04UQPX4MqI/0909ed10603c91bf4042a0d8230c8d54/ice-overlord.webp", "short_description": "Ralentiza", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Inmovilizar a un campe\u00f3n enemigo har\u00e1 que emita 3 rayos glaciales", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ", lo que crear\u00e1 zonas heladas que duran ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "3 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ". Los enemigos dentro de la zona helada reciben una ralentizaci\u00f3n. Esta ralentizaci\u00f3n dura ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "1,5 segundos incluso tras abandonar la zona", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Adem\u00e1s, obtienes una ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "capa de hielo protector", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " que aumenta tu armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica. Tras ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "2,5 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ", el hielo explota e inflige da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico a los enemigos cercanos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Ralentizaci\u00f3n:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " (20% + 1,5% de la vida adicional)\n ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 35 + 80% de la armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica adicionales\n ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o de explosi\u00f3n:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 25-125 + 5% de la vida adicional", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resumen:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Tras inmovilizar a un campe\u00f3n enemigo, crea zonas heladas que ralentizan y obtienes una capa defensiva que explota.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 12, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}], "subgroups": [{"id": 2, "key": "inspiration", "name": "Inspiration", "runes": [{"id": 23, "name": "AXIOMA ARCANO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2gnwFzyYfCDu0LU1yjmf3x/3c1b4244499a833103695e76b5ae6dca/1.png", "short_description": null, "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Aumentar\u00e1 el da\u00f1o, la curaci\u00f3n y el escudo de tu definitiva en un 10%", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ". Reducir\u00e1 el enfriamiento restante de tu definitiva en un 5% al participar en una eliminaci\u00f3n a campeones enemigos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 24, "name": "BANDA DE MAN\u00c1", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4UBlaL4EflRaJjWadznXBL/441d85d36000f5d8575fbb1ea9da9ac4/2.png", "short_description": "Man\u00e1", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con una habilidad o ataque potenciado aumenta permanentemente tu man\u00e1 m\u00e1ximo en 30, hasta 300 de man\u00e1.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 6, "name": "BOTANISTA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/60LHFObsbHELHzruzMkcw5/482a6969a3880517a18d156c35c787b2/3.png", "short_description": "Efectos de plantas potenciados", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cuando destruyes una planta, obtienes 25 de oro y efectos potenciados de la planta.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "La floranimas cerca de las torres tambi\u00e9n otorgan bonificaciones adicionales.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Floranimas: Otorga un 100% de oro adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Frutos de miel: Cuando se consumen, aumenta el efecto curativo un 20%.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Flor del adivino: Cuando se destruye, la vision que otorga dura un 20% m\u00e1s.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Pi\u00f1a explosiva: Tras el empuj\u00f3n, otorga un 40% de velocidad de movimiento durante 2,5 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 25, "name": "HEXTELLO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/62Y8VeYQTbHNawTRgRUrlX/38b422e2bddc43c1912bb86addb848ff/4.png", "short_description": "Deslizamiento", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cuando Destello est\u00e1 en enfriamiento, se reemplaza por Hextello. Te teleportas a una nueva ubicaci\u00f3n tras canalizar durante 2 segundos.\n", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 20 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 3, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 26, "name": "TRASCENDENCIA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6uMrlfVmI446t5QzMEkGSP/d64e74e514f15da901b13897ec3cac13/5.png", "short_description": "Reducci\u00f3n de enfriamiento", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga una bonificaci\u00f3n al alcanzar los siguientes niveles:", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al nivel 1, otorga 6 de velocidad de habilidades.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al nivel 6, otorga 6 de velocidad de habilidades adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al nivel 11, reduce un 15 % el enfriamiento de las habilidades b\u00e1sicas activas que golpeen a un objetivo (8 s de enfriamiento).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 27, "name": "CELERIDAD", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5PKIoHf8vbvBgD5WoUjHhv/c6647ea9aa7f01c501a01768df108b7f/6.png", "short_description": "Otorga movilidad", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Aumenta todas las bonificaciones de velocidad de movimiento que obtengas en un 7% y tambi\u00e9n otorga un 2% adicional de velocidad de movimiento.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 2, "name": "CONCENTRACI\u00d3N ABSOLUTA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2RniOIbPww2SQ0Ky1WQdJs/881965f2b343e538c9c2cfa3067758ee/7.png", "short_description": "Otorga da\u00f1o de ataque/poder de habilidad al tener mucha vida", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Con m\u00e1s del 70% de la vida, obtienes 1-15 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 2-30 de poder de habilidad adicional adaptable.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 28, "name": "PIROL\u00c1SER", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2JRTPjbP8S3jUsITEIY7Wu/46f51edfe5165d4b6605ef642e85d5cf/pirolaser.webp", "short_description": "Hostigar desde lejos", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infligir da\u00f1o a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con un habilidad lo quema, lo que inflige entre 21 y 49 de da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico adicional (seg\u00fan el nivel) tras 1 segundo.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 8 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 29, "name": "CAPA DEL NIMBO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/77kQ25McWVyoUfcIAyMbwI/8213cbe2b82a0e4f50e8a722308055ad/9.png", "short_description": "Velocidad de movimiento", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Tras usar un hechizo (Destello, Prender, etc.), obtienes un 10-40% de velocidad de movimiento adicional durante 3 segundos. La eficacia de esta mejora depende del enfriamiento del hechizo utilizado.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 4, "name": "SE AVECINA TORMENTA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/MAp5Vb5R4rpATqnpemenh/39ac7e642c298d408c2faaeb8b694dfe/10.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o f\u00edsico/m\u00e1gico creciente", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada 3 minutos, otorga un aumento de da\u00f1o f\u00edsico o da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico adaptable (lo que mas tenga, se te incrementa).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 30, "name": "SEMILLERO IXTAL\u00cd", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5YIYTqj8mbP2viU3GSMmFP/84353b60b49e61095226126eac40326d/11.png", "short_description": "Recoge semillas y cultiva plantas", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Las plantas golpeadas por ti o por tus aliados dejan caer semillas. Al recogerlas, las semillas sustituyen a tu talism\u00e1n durante 60 s y te otorgan velocidad de movimiento. Las semillas tardan 1 s en madurar tras plantarlas en la ubicaci\u00f3n objetivo. Las semillas se podr\u00e1n recoger cuando hayan transcurrido 2 min de partida.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "unordered-list", "content": [{"nodeType": "list-item", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Velocidad de movimiento adicional: 40% (disminuye a lo largo de 2,5 s).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, {"nodeType": "list-item", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada planta tiene un enfriamiento de 45 s.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}]}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 3, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}]}, {"id": 3, "key": "domination", "name": "Domination", "runes": [{"id": 15, "name": "GOLPE BAJO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4ntFH1KhIMPStJmlpXJ9rT/4038773f266bc8e562095028c02418a8/6.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Inflige de 10 a 45 de da\u00f1o verdadero adicional a los enemigos cuya velocidad de movimiento se haya visto reducida.\n\nEnfriamiento: 7 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 14, "name": "IMPACTO REPENTINO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2ifMmKfo5undgMX03rWSGa/b34209b4ffcddcb58fa8a2abc5b0d929/1.png", "short_description": "Penetraci\u00f3n de armadura/m\u00e1gica", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Durante los 4 s tras salir de sigilo o usar alg\u00fan deslizamiento, salto, teleportaci\u00f3n normal o instant\u00e1nea, infligir da\u00f1o a un campe\u00f3n enemigo inflige 10 + 5 * (nivel del campe\u00f3n - 1) de da\u00f1o verdadero (10 s de enfriamiento). ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 13, "name": "ATAQUE POTENCIADO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3r5eLtxprkkh16fFEh6HbS/a67b0b47e70c0ae9d5d4b29933c999de/8.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada 8 segundos. Potencia tu siguiente ataque, que infligir\u00e1 de 35 a 50 de da\u00f1o adaptable adicional (dependiendo del nivel)  a campeones enemigos. ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Los campeones a distancia infligen un 80 % del da\u00f1o. ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "\n", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 12, "name": "ASALTO ENCADENADO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/7mCuMbMPLH2SU5iqEDzPrg/5d4821911731104352f0c0255980ae40/2.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Despu\u00e9s de que una habilidad activa impacte a un campe\u00f3n enemigo, marcar\u00e1 al objetivo. Los siguientes dos ataques normales o habilidades activas tendr\u00e1n una bonificaci\u00f3n de da\u00f1o o poder de habilidad.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 11, "name": "TIRANO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/1woqrPHIGz4CS4bDYA2bSp/857bd967bdcd644c5b9b520d3c85a3ab/7.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cuando da\u00f1as a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con menos del 50% de vida, infligir\u00e1s da\u00f1o adicional adaptable.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 10, "name": "SOBERBIA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3Yc4WiYpwJ7PvoNhEfxnRS/ac08bfc02cdf2a4c2d1aefd50d35ed72/9.png", "short_description": "Los asesinatos aumenta el da\u00f1o de ataque/poder de habilidad de forma temporal", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Las eliminaciones de campeones enemigos en 3 segundos, tras infligirles da\u00f1o otorgan (5 + 1 por eliminaci\u00f3n de campe\u00f3n conseguida) de fuerza adaptable durante 30 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 32, "name": "COLECCI\u00d3N DE GLOBOS OCULARES", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6XMmYpa6sBC5zL2SG4UAj/af89df9a48d998c6bb1cec0f2937f9a7/4.png", "short_description": "Fuerza adaptable", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga 1 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 2 de poder de habilidad al conseguir asesinatos o asistencia de campeones. Se acumula hasta 10 veces. Con 10 acumulaciones, otorga 10 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 20 de poder de habilidad adicionales.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 31, "name": "CAZADOR INGENIOSO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5sP6ef6EQbvFmUKeMtZjGX/775065efa1219722fdb3700f93b38a91/5.png", "short_description": "Velocidad de objetos, velocidad de carga", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga 20 de velocidad de objetos. Otorga 5 de velocidad de objetos adicional por dada asesinato o asistencia de cada campe\u00f3n que consigas por primera vez. Se acumula hasta 5 veces.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 8, "name": "CAZADOR INCESANTE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/T4PyCjRsoN6ancvBJYa0a/55ee275865c878c77032074ef67cbd38/10.png", "short_description": "Los asesinatos otorgan velocidad de movimiento fuera de combate", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga 10 de velocidad de movimiento fuera de combate. Por cada eliminaci\u00f3n de un campe\u00f3n o monstruo \u00e9pico que consigas, otorga 2 de velocidad de movimiento fuera de combate. Se acumula hasta 5 veces.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 9, "name": "GUARDI\u00c1N ZOMBI", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/cWlSVBz2TQl6JsXHSPcpP/2c62a8ddb68f4736dca9a424b7b74731/3.png", "short_description": "Visi\u00f3n y fuerza adaptable", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Destruir un guardi\u00e1n enemigo crea un guardi\u00e1n zombi en su lugar, lo que otorga visi\u00f3n del \u00e1rea circundante durante 120 segundos. Adem\u00e1s, otorga 3 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 6 de poder de habilidad. Se acumula hasta 5 veces. Otorga 10 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 20 poder de habilidad al conseguir 5 acumulaciones.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 3, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}]}]}, "options": [{"id": 1, "label": "1\u00ba opci\u00f3n", "keystone_id": 51, "subgroup_ids": [3, 2], "selected_rune_ids": [51, 14, 11, 32, 4]}]}, "spells": [{"id": 6, "name": "APLASTAR", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/01PFIu8MuZDy1Pzne0icgR/da6b95d04b3407781f8c3a60d4e56b51/smite_lol_hanu_bbwr.webp", "key": null}, {"id": 7, "name": "DESTELLO", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/73wkaLCgLyxb9lZSThTLYi/62613bf9f3ce7cebdf09f4579091a5bf/Flash_wr_bb.png", "key": null}], "champion": {"id": 43, "contentfulId": "5rbienOaraOLLOJDVEWirB", "local