l": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3zXlF27fWtkh2dERbIW4M5/8b7551a391678e89da671702cdcd05fb/FUERZA_DEL_VIENTO.webp", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 50, "attack_speed": 15, "critical_strike": 25, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 5, "cost": 3100, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Aguacero (activo): Lanza un proyectil en la direcci\u00f3n objetivo y dispara 3 proyectiles al enemigo con menos salud cerca del destino, infligiendo un total de 40-125 (seg\u00fan el nivel) + 35% de da\u00f1o f\u00edsico adicional. (Tiempo de reutilizaci\u00f3n: 60 s)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 3, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 1108, "name": "GREBAS DE BERSERKER [ NIVEL 3 ]", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/378TrbaS7yTUxljpIFz9OA/2654622526345df68f0e8aff77f3d8df/nkjklo.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": true, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 50, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 5, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 2200, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Hoja bendita: Los ataques b\u00e1sicos restauran 12 puntos de salud al impactar.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Marcha noxiana: Cuando tus ataques b\u00e1sicos impactan a campeones, obtienes un aumento instant\u00e1neo de velocidad de movimiento del 15 % (cuerpo a cuerpo) / 10 % (a distancia) durante 2 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 4, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 50, "name": "Hoja del rey arruinado", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/nEPlAywBMn7adH63rVtPS/2a9509c33e74490e179f0186f03ecd52/hoja_hanu.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 25, "attack_speed": 35, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 12, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 3000, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpes de ruina: Los ataques infligen da\u00f1o f\u00edsico adicional equivalente a un 7% de la vida actual del enemigo al golpear. (Los ataques cuerpo a cuerpo infligen 10%). Da\u00f1o minimo:15. Da\u00f1o m\u00e1ximo contra monstruos: 60.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\nDrenaje: Golpear a un campe\u00f3n con 3 ataques o habilidades inflige 30-100 de da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico y roba un 25% de su velocidad de movimiento durante 2 segundos. (60 segundos de enfriamiento).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 5, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 20, "name": "Hurac\u00e1n de Runaan", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6LtfwiR1iP18W6GV6fB2ED/d5d9a29b3d37c246d71ddfb52f7dec56/runan_hanu.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 35, "critical_strike": 25, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 3000, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Furia del viento:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " los ataques golpean a 2 enemigos cercanos adicionales, lo que inflige un 60% de da\u00f1o f\u00edsico. Estos ataques pueden infligir golpes cr\u00edticos y activan efectos de impacto.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Espada de viento: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Los ataque infligen 15 de da\u00f1o f\u00edsico adicional al impactar contra objetivos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 6, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 54, "name": "Filo infinito", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/20DYX9fLm6V10bwum8Xb7h/7dc29296ae0232aaa3297bbb61af428b/filo_inifito_hanu_bbwr.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 65, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 25, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 3200, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infinito:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Los golpes cr\u00edticos infligen un 205% de da\u00f1o en lugar de un 175%.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\n", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Sobrepaso del l\u00edmite: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cuando la probabilidad de impacto cr\u00edtico total obtenida con objetos supera el 100 %, cada 1 % de probabilidad de cr\u00edtico sobrante otorga un 0,6 % de da\u00f1o cr\u00edtico.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 7, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}], "optionalItems": [], "runes": {"catalog": {"keystones": [{"id": 51, "name": "Electrocutar", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3VeCp8BTJgS0ZJsJYnfn1l/1da19c1f4bcc08023deaee5ad57dc901/electrocutar_hanu.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n con 3 ataques o habilidades diferentes es un margen de 3 segundos hace que inflijas da\u00f1o adaptable adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\nDa\u00f1o: 40-194 (por nivel) +35% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 20% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico).\nEnfriamiento: 20-13 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 50, "name": "COSECHA OSCURA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/206PWdBKdbq3sYbz5rWhqL/1083fb5bae50c0689715d6544f9f780a/dark-harvest.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Realizar da\u00f1o a campeones enemigo con menos del 50% te permite cosechar su alma, infligiendo da\u00f1o adaptable y aumentando el da\u00f1o de la runa en 10. ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "20 segundos de enfriamiento por campe\u00f3n \u00fanico, que se reduce en un segundo por participar en una eliminaci\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 49, "name": "FORTALECIMIENTO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4d5eghiJBOy4xnH2qraRXN/9767cc3edf8c9d73961d77bdf6940a84/pfortalecimiento_hanu_png.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo, amplificaci\u00f3n del da\u00f1o", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con 3 ataques consecutivos inflige da\u00f1o adaptable adicional y lo deja vulnerable, lo que ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "potencia el da\u00f1o que infliges un 8 % hasta que abandonas el combate con campeones ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Mientras sea vulnerable, tus ataques infligen da\u00f1o verdadero adicional al objetivo. Cuando el objetivo sale del estado vulnerable, vulnerabilidad entra en enfriamiento y no se puede aplicar a ning\u00fan enemigo durante 6 segundos.\n\nDa\u00f1o adaptable: 40-180 (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o verdadero: 6-20 (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 48, "name": "COMP\u00c1S LETAL", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3VjyOLza6ankvBKcZzGoJN/c16331dbb6922c9e4d6fbce1f91e0e7d/compas_letal_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Velocidad de ataque", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Obtienes velocidad de ataque acumulable al atacar a campeones enemigos. Se acumula hasta 6 veces. Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes alcance adicional y puedes superar el l\u00edmite de velocidad de ataque.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "unordered-list", "content": [{"nodeType": "list-item", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada acumulaci\u00f3n aumenta la velocidad de ataque un 8-16 % (cuerpo a cuerpo) o un 3-12 % (a distancia) durante 6 s.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, {"nodeType": "list-item", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes 50 (cuerpo a cuerpo) o 75 (a distancia) de alcance de ataque.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}]}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 3, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 52, "name": "PIES VELOCES", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4bquJRMlzSfhjmgsH9Ipig/07fe958018fa96805a09fd91840ebc31/pies_veloces_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Movilidad, curaci\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Moverse, atacar y utilizar habilidades genera acumulaciones de energ\u00eda. A las 100 acumulaciones, tu siguiente ataque te cura, te otorga velocidad de movimiento adicional y restaura man\u00e1 o energ\u00eda si atacas a un campe\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n: 15-85 (por nivel) + 30% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 30% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico) ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Mejora la velocidad de movimiento: 20% durante 1 segundo", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al atacar a un campe\u00f3n, restaura un 8% del man\u00e1 o un 8% de la energ\u00eda que te falte.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n: Cuerpo a cuerpo: 35% | A distancia: 15% al atacar a s\u00fabdito o monstruos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 4, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 47, "name": "CONQUISTADOR", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6ZqBIEsBgpDsZrvw2jbrvz/0673ee14b9321dba3b2878ee9e277a81/conqueror_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Acumula da\u00f1o y succi\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n con ataques o habildiades diferentes otorga acumulaciones de fuerza adaptable. Se acumula hasta 6 veces. Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes omnisucci\u00f3n adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada acumulaci\u00f3n otorga: 2- 6 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 3-9 de poder de habilidad adicional durante 6 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "La mejora del m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones otorga un 8% (cuerpo a cuerpo) o un 5% (a distancia) de omnisucci\u00f3n adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 5, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 53, "name": "Garras del inmortal", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5s9rlUzcw1ienCCBvgphzV/e2885baf394a5830eb57e8385dbe3c1c/desgarrador_hanu.png", "short_description": "Control, ofensiva", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada 3 segundos que pases en combate, se potenciar\u00e1 tu siguiente ataque contra un campe\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\n", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico adicional:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 2 % de la vida m\u00e1xima.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n otorgada:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 2,5 % de la vida m\u00e1xima.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Vida m\u00e1xima obtenida por tiempo: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "10.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 6, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 3, "name": "GUARDI\u00c1N", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5RCknJe0sQfxfQyIhoJCMJ/85c3c532319589d9e0b387f1ae4395ca/guardian.webp", "short_description": "Protecci\u00f3n, escudo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Proteges a los aliados que se encuentren a 350 unidades de ti y a los aliados que sean objetivo de tus habilidades durante 2,5 segundos.", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Si durante este tiempo tu aliado o t\u00fa recib\u00eds m\u00e1s que una peque\u00f1a cantidad de da\u00f1o, ambos obten\u00e9is un escudo durante ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "2 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Escudo:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 45-180 + 5% de la vida adicional + 15% del poder de habilidad\n", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 40-20 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resumen:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Proteges a aliados cercanos o afectados por tus habilidades, y si reciben da\u00f1o, ambos obten\u00e9is un escudo.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 7, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 46, "name": "AERY", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/vuKrT72b1RPH90CC6ZmF9/82aabd1378f97ee6fe2cc954070d68b0/aery_hanu.png", "short_description": "Desgaste, protecci\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Tus ataques y habilidades env\u00edan a Aery a un objetivo para da\u00f1ar a los enemigos u otorgar un escudo a los aliados.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o: 15-70 (por nivel) + 20% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 10% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Escudo: 30-140 (por nivel) + 40% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 20% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "No se puede enviar Aery de nuevo hasta que vuelva a ti.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 8, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 45, "name": "COMETA ARCANO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/fDZC5cahgbxovDlJKc8vv/3f95eb5505b95e3f638e0e4d9b892a14/cometa_hanu_bbwr.png", "short_description": "Hostigar desde lejos", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infligir da\u00f1o con una habilidad a un campe\u00f3n proyecta un cometa hacia su ubicaci\u00f3n. Cuando un cometa golpea a un campe\u00f3n enemigo, aumenta el da\u00f1o del siguiente. ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 16-8 segundos (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 9, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 44, "name": "IRRUPCI\u00d3N DE FASE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5BwiJwxAuC4xTkDGeE5bui/2047286bea46afe1f871f7a3e7625078/324314341234123_hanu_wr_bb.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Movilidad, velocidad de habilidades", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Utilizar 3 ataques b\u00e1sicos o habilidades contra un campe\u00f3n enemigo en 4 segundos otorga velocidad de habilidades y velocidad de movimiento. Adem\u00e1s, reduce el enfriamiento restante de  las habilidades b\u00e1sicas en un 20%.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Duraci\u00f3n: 3 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Velocidad de movimiento: Cuerpo a cuerpo : 40%-60% (por nivel) | A distancia: 30%-50% (por nivel) \nVelocidad de habilidades: 25.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 12 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 10, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 43, "name": "PRIMER GOLPE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/533TP9AHOp0BMekk0dcY5Q/0b782a3e2a6e09a6031761a4f3ea493d/8369.png", "short_description": "Oro y da\u00f1o adicionales", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infligir da\u00f1o a un campe\u00f3n enemigo durante los primeros 0,25 segundos despu\u00e9s de entrar en combate contra el te otorga 5 de oro y el efecto de primer golpe durante 3 segundos, lo que te permite infligirle un 7% de da\u00f1o verdadero adiciona. Cuando el efecto desaparece, obtienes oro seg\u00fan el da\u00f1o adicional infligido durante la duraci\u00f3n del mismo. \nOro adicional: 100% (cuerpo a cuerpo)/85 % (a distancia) del da\u00f1o adicional\n", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 20-13 (dependiendo del nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 11, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 5, "name": "MEJORA GLACIAL", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/38NzEB19PT7D04UQPX4MqI/0909ed10603c91bf4042a0d8230c8d54/ice-overlord.webp", "short_description": "Ralentiza", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Inmovilizar a un campe\u00f3n enemigo har\u00e1 que emita 3 rayos glaciales", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ", lo que crear\u00e1 zonas heladas que duran ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "3 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ". Los enemigos dentro de la zona helada reciben una ralentizaci\u00f3n. Esta ralentizaci\u00f3n dura ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "1,5 segundos incluso tras abandonar la zona", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Adem\u00e1s, obtienes una ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "capa de hielo protector", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " que aumenta tu armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica. Tras ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "2,5 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ", el hielo explota e inflige da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico a los enemigos cercanos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Ralentizaci\u00f3n:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " (20% + 1,5% de la vida adicional)\n ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 35 + 80% de la armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica adicionales\n ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o de explosi\u00f3n:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 25-125 + 5% de la vida adicional", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resumen:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Tras inmovilizar a un campe\u00f3n enemigo, crea zonas heladas que ralentizan y obtienes una capa defensiva que explota.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 12, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}], "subgroups": [{"id": 1, "key": "precision", "name": "Precision", "runes": [{"id": 16, "name": "BRUTAL", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3QRaNINlIPQBGfVIHdgQSz/e730b3c7f340bde51ba0cafab8cb0968/1.png", "short_description": "Resumen:  Da\u00f1o al golpear", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Los ataques b\u00e1sicos infligen 7-21 de da\u00f1o adaptable adicional al impactar contra campeones.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 21, "name": "TRIUNFO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3K9y9gZLyb2fSqjWvSumDD/d069e999f46722950ed147ef1ed840d6/8.png", "short_description": "Ejecutar, curaci\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Las asistencias y asesinatos de campeones restauran un 10% de la vida perdida y un 10% del man\u00e1 y la energ\u00eda m\u00e1ximos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 7, "name": "FERVOR DE BATALLA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2gqbPqL16cEYWunqjjrZeY/a1cddab553e98f96d6577a112eceab60/5.png", "short_description": "Aumenta el da\u00f1o durante combates prolongados", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Obtienes un 2% de ampliaci\u00f3n de da\u00f1o de las habilidades b\u00e1sicas acumulable cada 1 segundo mientras estas en combate con un campe\u00f3n. Se acumula hasta 3 veces y solo tiene efecto contra campeones enemigos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 19, "name": "\u00daLTIMO ESFUERZO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2fmB15gCvlkJc6Y6O7El14/6767f97d5a8b382379c3d46902ab33cf/6.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cuando tu vida esta por debajo del 60%, los ataques asestados a campeones enemigos infligen de 5% a 11% de da\u00f1o adaptable adicional. Otorga el m\u00e1ximo de da\u00f1o adicional con menos de un 30% de vida.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 1, "name": "DERRIBADO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/42RrRB4s9exAs26rrW314M/93e7738d11872d859b7d35eb5079590b/2.png", "short_description": "Elimina campeones con mucha vida", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Tus ataques infligen un 8% de da\u00f1o adaptable adicional a campeones enemigos con m\u00e1s del 60% de vida.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 20, "name": "GOLPE DE GRACIA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/SZepSjSD1ZpnYSSlneob1/fc70d04f4a47604609a5adc7e94547a9/7.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Inflige un 8% de da\u00f1o adaptable adicional al infligir da\u00f1o a campeones enemigos que est\u00e9n por debajo del 40% de vida.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 17, "name": "LEYENDA: PRESTEZA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/61lmeZoRmIN6i8KGNEFHtB/431ba2945caec9b032d1f21930324017/3.png", "short_description": "Velocidad de ataque adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga un 3% de velocidad de ataque. Asesina a monstruos, s\u00fabditos y campeones enemigos o consigue asistencias para obtener hasta un 20% de velocidad de ataque adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 22, "name": "LEYENDA: TENACIDAD", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5ZtbnrEIGFMJxO94mEMBHS/0294c3e07c01d585411cb3e44986a51a/9.png", "short_description": "Tenacidad y resistencia a las ralentizaciones", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga un 3% de tenacidad y un 3% de resistencia a las ralentizaciones. Asesina a un monstruos, s\u00fabditos y campeones enemigos o consigue asistencias para obtener hasta un 15% de tenacidad adicional y un 20% de resistencia a las ralentizaciones.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 18, "name": "LEYENDA: LINAJE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3QTSfQSBDoN99RLQgJKWFB/18a0ed3062820aa5857489693a825b4b/4.png", "short_description": "Ominisucci\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga un 1% de omnisucci\u00f3n. Asesina a monstruos, s\u00fabditos y campeones enemigos o consigue asistencias para obtener hasta un 7% de ominisucci\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}]}, {"id": 4, "key": "resolve", "name": "Resolve", "runes": [{"id": 42, "name": "DEMOLER", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2hk8l4vhux7JGKdxk6pSYi/c463f225442fd4e57a248c9b64a31031/1.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Destruye torretas", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al estar a 5.5 de distancia de una torreta enemiga, obtienes una carga cada 0.5 segundos, hasta un m\u00e1ximo de 6. Con el m\u00e1ximo de cargas, el siguiente ataque b\u00e1sico que asestes a la torreta inflige (", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "100 + 22", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "% de la vida m\u00e1xima)) de da\u00f1o f\u00edsico.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 30 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 41, "name": "FUENTE DE VIDA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/7e5qby6IsoHn1y9T4Xinrn/645aac58dbd6c9b99a4aba78aa9e9475/2.png", "short_description": "Curaci\u00f3n del equipo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": " Golpear a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con ataque o habilidades lo marca. Cuando t\u00fa o tus aliados inflig\u00eds da\u00f1o a los campeones marcados, os cur\u00e1is.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Solo se puede activar este efecto una vez por marca.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n a aliados: 3% de la vida m\u00e1xima de vida + un 15% del poder de habilidad.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n propia: 1% de la vida m\u00e1xima + un 5% del poder de habilidad.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Duraci\u00f3n de la marca: 3 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 15 segundos para campeones cuerpo a cuerpo, 20 segundos para campeones a distancia.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Se reducen un 25% las curaciones consecutivas que provengan de las marcas de otros aliados.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 40, "name": "CORAJE DEL COLOSO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6dwIgbgQPsCWklfO3f1Mmy/810c8f0231e085b46afb41c5b9cf110e/3.png", "short_description": "Escudo", "long_description": {"nodeTy