"data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 37, "name": "ORBE ANULADOR", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3Rtq7nXP0YXo15rB3Fp8VT/cadf7c749fe8daa55a64d152b6632bd8/6.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Otorga un escudo al tener poca vida", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Si un campe\u00f3n enemigo te inflige da\u00f1o como para bajar del 35% de tu vida m\u00e1xima, obtienes un escudo durante 4 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Escudo: 60 a 190  (dependiendo del nivel)\r", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 60 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 36, "name": "Revestimiento de huesos", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/1GVg4j9fgzwnK2VR6s44KZ/be42989ea11cff3d248049bf4252f7c1/7.png", "short_description": "Bloquea da\u00f1o de combos", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al recibir da\u00f1o de un campe\u00f3n, el ataque o habilidad actual y los 3 siguientes ataques o habilidades de campeones que te golpeen en los pr\u00f3ximos 1,5 segundos te infligen 30-60 (depende del nivel) menos de da\u00f1o (30 segundos de enfriamiento).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 35, "name": "SOBRECRECIMIENTO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/ik785Cw2HCVSsIGLd5Bv3/537b644c357546adf5035b820e1b1a08/8.png", "short_description": "Vida adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "cont