ition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 13, "name": "Lanza de Shojin", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/7aKTzUUDzvoI4KudRGA7o9/82fbfb8482c026093a972bc653170741/spear-of-shojin.webp", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 45, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 450, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 5, "cost": 3100, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Voluntad Enfocada: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infligir da\u00f1o a monstruos o enemigos con habilidades aumenta el da\u00f1o de habilidad y pasivo de tu campe\u00f3n un 3% durante 6 s. (Se acumula 4 veces)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Fuerza de Drag\u00f3n: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Obtiene 25 de aceleraci\u00f3n de habilidades b\u00e1sicas.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 3, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 1110, "name": "GREBAS CODICIOSAS [ NIVEL 3 ]", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/Zzrr6g7zPMN2UhhWkvzCR/a0fa34752c020afb61557fb79f71d94f/vcbnb.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": true, "attack_damage": 0, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 2000, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Equilibrio de poder: Obtienes 12 puntos de da\u00f1o de ataque o 20 puntos de poder de habilidad.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Conversi\u00f3n: Obt\u00e9n un 5% de Omnivampirismo + un 0,5% de Omnivampirismo por cada participaci\u00f3n en una eliminaci\u00f3n, hasta un 5% adicional y un m\u00e1ximo del 10% de Omnivampirismo.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Ahora y para siempre: Mientras tengas m\u00e1s del 50% de salud, infliges un 50% de da\u00f1o adicional. Mientras tengas menos del 50% de salud, obtienes un 12% m\u00e1s de curaci\u00f3n y protecci\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 4, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 56, "name": "Rencor de Serylda", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2KsExoqfytdwp2azBsz6Hy/8cef78e6a6f53dae40cfc87c99c9a6eb/seryldahanu.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 40, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 30, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 15, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 0, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 3300, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\u00daltimas palabras: 33", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "%", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " de penetraci\u00f3n de armadura.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "G\u00e9lido: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Las habilidades activas que infligen da\u00f1o y los ataques potenciados ralentizan a los enemigos en un 30% durante 1 segundo.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Aplica Congelaci\u00f3n a los enemigos ralentizados por G\u00e9lido durante 6 s. Con 3 acumulaciones de Congelaci\u00f3n, se consumen todas las acumulaciones para aplicar sangrado al objetivo, lo que inflige (30-100 + 70 % del da\u00f1o de ataque adicional) durante 2 s. Adem\u00e1s, tambi\u00e9n aplica heridas graves durante 3 s (5 s de enfriamiento).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 5, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 30, "name": "Baile de la muerte", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6CHP0qLzfi5lH22wYj2Wdx/d123891349e3949c3a582d7d7944020a/baile_hanu.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 35, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 15, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 40, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 3000, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Baile: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Las eliminaciones de campeones eliminan la reserva de da\u00f1o restante de ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cauterizar", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " y restauran un 12% de tu vida m\u00e1xima a lo largo de 2 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cauterizar:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " El 27% del da\u00f1o recibido (15% si se trata de un campe\u00f3n a distancia) se inflige a lo largo de 3 segundos como da\u00f1o verdadero.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 6, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}, {"id": 86, "name": "\u00c1ngel de la guarda", "slug": null, "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6Or0UaYYsqAQqEalzvST14/bb176d4587589ea9a46395ec14396abb/angel_hanu.png", "boots": false, "enchantment": false, "attack_damage": 40, "attack_speed": 0, "critical_strike": 0, "armor_penetration": 0, "armor_penetration_percentage": 0, "physical_vamp": 0, "ability_power": 0, "ability_haste": 0, "mana": 0, "magic_penetration": 0, "magic_penetration_percentage": 0, "magical_vamp": 0, "health": 0, "armor": 40, "magic_resistance": 0, "health_regeneration": 0, "movement_speed": 0, "cost": 3400, "stats_passive": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resucitar:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Tras sufrir da\u00f1o letal, restaura un 50% de la vida b\u00e1sica y un %30 del man\u00e1 m\u00e1ximo despu\u00e9s de 4 segundos de inmovilidad. (210 segundos de enfriamiento)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "pivot": {"slot": 7, "group": "core", "condition": null, "priority": 0, "is_default": true, "variant_of_item_id": null}}], "optionalItems": [], "runes": {"catalog": {"keystones": [{"id": 51, "name": "Electrocutar", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3VeCp8BTJgS0ZJsJYnfn1l/1da19c1f4bcc08023deaee5ad57dc901/electrocutar_hanu.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n con 3 ataques o habilidades diferentes es un margen de 3 segundos hace que inflijas da\u00f1o adaptable adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\nDa\u00f1o: 40-194 (por nivel) +35% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 20% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico).\nEnfriamiento: 20-13 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 50, "name": "COSECHA OSCURA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/206PWdBKdbq3sYbz5rWhqL/1083fb5bae50c0689715d6544f9f780a/dark-harvest.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Realizar da\u00f1o a campeones enemigo con menos del 50% te permite cosechar su alma, infligiendo da\u00f1o adaptable y aumentando el da\u00f1o de la runa en 10. ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "20 segundos de enfriamiento por campe\u00f3n \u00fanico, que se reduce en un segundo por participar en una eliminaci\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 49, "name": "FORTALECIMIENTO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4d5eghiJBOy4xnH2qraRXN/9767cc3edf8c9d73961d77bdf6940a84/pfortalecimiento_hanu_png.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo, amplificaci\u00f3n del da\u00f1o", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con 3 ataques consecutivos inflige da\u00f1o adaptable adicional y lo deja vulnerable, lo que ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "potencia el da\u00f1o que infliges un 8 % hasta que abandonas el combate con campeones ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Mientras sea vulnerable, tus ataques infligen da\u00f1o verdadero adicional al objetivo. Cuando el objetivo sale del estado vulnerable, vulnerabilidad entra en enfriamiento y no se puede aplicar a ning\u00fan enemigo durante 6 segundos.\n\nDa\u00f1o adaptable: 40-180 (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o verdadero: 6-20 (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 48, "name": "COMP\u00c1S LETAL", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3VjyOLza6ankvBKcZzGoJN/c16331dbb6922c9e4d6fbce1f91e0e7d/compas_letal_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Velocidad de ataque", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Obtienes velocidad de ataque acumulable al atacar a campeones enemigos. Se acumula hasta 6 veces. Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes alcance adicional y puedes superar el l\u00edmite de velocidad de ataque.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "unordered-list", "content": [{"nodeType": "list-item", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada acumulaci\u00f3n aumenta la velocidad de ataque un 8-16 % (cuerpo a cuerpo) o un 3-12 % (a distancia) durante 6 s.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, {"nodeType": "list-item", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes 50 (cuerpo a cuerpo) o 75 (a distancia) de alcance de ataque.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}]}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 3, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 52, "name": "PIES VELOCES", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4bquJRMlzSfhjmgsH9Ipig/07fe958018fa96805a09fd91840ebc31/pies_veloces_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Movilidad, curaci\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Moverse, atacar y utilizar habilidades genera acumulaciones de energ\u00eda. A las 100 acumulaciones, tu siguiente ataque te cura, te otorga velocidad de movimiento adicional y restaura man\u00e1 o energ\u00eda si atacas a un campe\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n: 15-85 (por nivel) + 30% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 30% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico) ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Mejora la velocidad de movimiento: 20% durante 1 segundo", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al atacar a un campe\u00f3n, restaura un 8% del man\u00e1 o un 8% de la energ\u00eda que te falte.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n: Cuerpo a cuerpo: 35% | A distancia: 15% al atacar a s\u00fabdito o monstruos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 4, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 47, "name": "CONQUISTADOR", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6ZqBIEsBgpDsZrvw2jbrvz/0673ee14b9321dba3b2878ee9e277a81/conqueror_hanu.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Acumula da\u00f1o y succi\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Golpear a un campe\u00f3n con ataques o habildiades diferentes otorga acumulaciones de fuerza adaptable. Se acumula hasta 6 veces. Con el m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones, obtienes omnisucci\u00f3n adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada acumulaci\u00f3n otorga: 2- 6 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 3-9 de poder de habilidad adicional durante 6 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "La mejora del m\u00e1ximo de acumulaciones otorga un 8% (cuerpo a cuerpo) o un 5% (a distancia) de omnisucci\u00f3n adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 5, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 53, "name": "Garras del inmortal", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5s9rlUzcw1ienCCBvgphzV/e2885baf394a5830eb57e8385dbe3c1c/desgarrador_hanu.png", "short_description": "Control, ofensiva", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada 3 segundos que pases en combate, se potenciar\u00e1 tu siguiente ataque contra un campe\u00f3n.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "\n", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico adicional:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 2 % de la vida m\u00e1xima.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n otorgada:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 2,5 % de la vida m\u00e1xima.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Vida m\u00e1xima obtenida por tiempo: ", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "10.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 6, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 3, "name": "GUARDI\u00c1N", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5RCknJe0sQfxfQyIhoJCMJ/85c3c532319589d9e0b387f1ae4395ca/guardian.webp", "short_description": "Protecci\u00f3n, escudo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Proteges a los aliados que se encuentren a 350 unidades de ti y a los aliados que sean objetivo de tus habilidades durante 2,5 segundos.", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Si durante este tiempo tu aliado o t\u00fa recib\u00eds m\u00e1s que una peque\u00f1a cantidad de da\u00f1o, ambos obten\u00e9is un escudo durante ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "2 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Escudo:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 45-180 + 5% de la vida adicional + 15% del poder de habilidad\n", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 40-20 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resumen:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Proteges a aliados cercanos o afectados por tus habilidades, y si reciben da\u00f1o, ambos obten\u00e9is un escudo.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 7, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 46, "name": "AERY", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/vuKrT72b1RPH90CC6ZmF9/82aabd1378f97ee6fe2cc954070d68b0/aery_hanu.png", "short_description": "Desgaste, protecci\u00f3n", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Tus ataques y habilidades env\u00edan a Aery a un objetivo para da\u00f1ar a los enemigos u otorgar un escudo a los aliados.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o: 15-70 (por nivel) + 20% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 10% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Escudo: 30-140 (por nivel) + 40% (da\u00f1o f\u00edsico) + 20% (da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "No se puede enviar Aery de nuevo hasta que vuelva a ti.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 8, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 45, "name": "COMETA ARCANO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/fDZC5cahgbxovDlJKc8vv/3f95eb5505b95e3f638e0e4d9b892a14/cometa_hanu_bbwr.png", "short_description": "Hostigar desde lejos", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infligir da\u00f1o con una habilidad a un campe\u00f3n proyecta un cometa hacia su ubicaci\u00f3n. Cuando un cometa golpea a un campe\u00f3n enemigo, aumenta el da\u00f1o del siguiente. ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 16-8 segundos (por nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 9, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 44, "name": "IRRUPCI\u00d3N DE FASE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5BwiJwxAuC4xTkDGeE5bui/2047286bea46afe1f871f7a3e7625078/324314341234123_hanu_wr_bb.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Movilidad, velocidad de habilidades", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Utilizar 3 ataques b\u00e1sicos o habilidades contra un campe\u00f3n enemigo en 4 segundos otorga velocidad de habilidades y velocidad de movimiento. Adem\u00e1s, reduce el enfriamiento restante de  las habilidades b\u00e1sicas en un 20%.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Duraci\u00f3n: 3 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Velocidad de movimiento: Cuerpo a cuerpo : 40%-60% (por nivel) | A distancia: 30%-50% (por nivel) \nVelocidad de habilidades: 25.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 12 segundos", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 10, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 43, "name": "PRIMER GOLPE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/533TP9AHOp0BMekk0dcY5Q/0b782a3e2a6e09a6031761a4f3ea493d/8369.png", "short_description": "Oro y da\u00f1o adicionales", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Infligir da\u00f1o a un campe\u00f3n enemigo durante los primeros 0,25 segundos despu\u00e9s de entrar en combate contra el te otorga 5 de oro y el efecto de primer golpe durante 3 segundos, lo que te permite infligirle un 7% de da\u00f1o verdadero adiciona. Cuando el efecto desaparece, obtienes oro seg\u00fan el da\u00f1o adicional infligido durante la duraci\u00f3n del mismo. \nOro adicional: 100% (cuerpo a cuerpo)/85 % (a distancia) del da\u00f1o adicional\n", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 20-13 (dependiendo del nivel)", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 11, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}, {"id": 5, "name": "MEJORA GLACIAL", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/38NzEB19PT7D04UQPX4MqI/0909ed10603c91bf4042a0d8230c8d54/ice-overlord.webp", "short_description": "Ralentiza", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Inmovilizar a un campe\u00f3n enemigo har\u00e1 que emita 3 rayos glaciales", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ", lo que crear\u00e1 zonas heladas que duran ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "3 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ". Los enemigos dentro de la zona helada reciben una ralentizaci\u00f3n. Esta ralentizaci\u00f3n dura ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "1,5 segundos incluso tras abandonar la zona", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ".", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Adem\u00e1s, obtienes una ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "capa de hielo protector", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " que aumenta tu armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica. Tras ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "2,5 segundos", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": ", el hielo explota e inflige da\u00f1o m\u00e1gico a los enemigos cercanos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Ralentizaci\u00f3n:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " (20% + 1,5% de la vida adicional)\n ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 35 + 80% de la armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica adicionales\n ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Da\u00f1o de explosi\u00f3n:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " 25-125 + 5% de la vida adicional", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Resumen:", "marks": [{"object": "mark", "type": "bold"}], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": " Tras inmovilizar a un campe\u00f3n enemigo, crea zonas heladas que ralentizan y obtienes una capa defensiva que explota.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 12, "type": {"key": "keystone", "name": "Keystone"}}], "subgroups": [{"id": 3, "key": "domination", "name": "Domination", "runes": [{"id": 15, "name": "GOLPE BAJO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/4ntFH1KhIMPStJmlpXJ9rT/4038773f266bc8e562095028c02418a8/6.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Inflige de 10 a 45 de da\u00f1o verdadero adicional a los enemigos cuya velocidad de movimiento se haya visto reducida.\n\nEnfriamiento: 7 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 14, "name": "IMPACTO REPENTINO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2ifMmKfo5undgMX03rWSGa/b34209b4ffcddcb58fa8a2abc5b0d929/1.png", "short_description": "Penetraci\u00f3n de armadura/m\u00e1gica", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Durante los 4 s tras salir de sigilo o usar alg\u00fan deslizamiento, salto, teleportaci\u00f3n normal o instant\u00e1nea, infligir da\u00f1o a un campe\u00f3n enemigo inflige 10 + 5 * (nivel del campe\u00f3n - 1) de da\u00f1o verdadero (10 s de enfriamiento). ", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 13, "name": "ATAQUE POTENCIADO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3r5eLtxprkkh16fFEh6HbS/a67b0b47e70c0ae9d5d4b29933c999de/8.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cada 8 segundos. Potencia tu siguiente ataque, que infligir\u00e1 de 35 a 50 de da\u00f1o adaptable adicional (dependiendo del nivel)  a campeones enemigos. ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "Los campeones a distancia infligen un 80 % del da\u00f1o. ", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "\n", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 12, "name": "ASALTO ENCADENADO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/7mCuMbMPLH2SU5iqEDzPrg/5d4821911731104352f0c0255980ae40/2.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Despu\u00e9s de que una habilidad activa impacte a un campe\u00f3n enemigo, marcar\u00e1 al objetivo. Los siguientes dos ataques normales o habilidades activas tendr\u00e1n una bonificaci\u00f3n de da\u00f1o o poder de habilidad.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 11, "name": "TIRANO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/1woqrPHIGz4CS4bDYA2bSp/857bd967bdcd644c5b9b520d3c85a3ab/7.png", "short_description": "Da\u00f1o explosivo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cuando da\u00f1as a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con menos del 50% de vida, infligir\u00e1s da\u00f1o adicional adaptable.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 10, "name": "SOBERBIA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3Yc4WiYpwJ7PvoNhEfxnRS/ac08bfc02cdf2a4c2d1aefd50d35ed72/9.png", "short_description": "Los asesinatos aumenta el da\u00f1o de ataque/poder de habilidad de forma temporal", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Las eliminaciones de campeones enemigos en 3 segundos, tras infligirles da\u00f1o otorgan (5 + 1 por eliminaci\u00f3n de campe\u00f3n conseguida) de fuerza adaptable durante 30 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 32, "name": "COLECCI\u00d3N DE GLOBOS OCULARES", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6XMmYpa6sBC5zL2SG4UAj/af89df9a48d998c6bb1cec0f2937f9a7/4.png", "short_description": "Fuerza adaptable", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga 1 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 2 de poder de habilidad al conseguir asesinatos o asistencia de campeones. Se acumula hasta 10 veces. Con 10 acumulaciones, otorga 10 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 20 de poder de habilidad adicionales.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 31, "name": "CAZADOR INGENIOSO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/5sP6ef6EQbvFmUKeMtZjGX/775065efa1219722fdb3700f93b38a91/5.png", "short_description": "Velocidad de objetos, velocidad de carga", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga 20 de velocidad de objetos. Otorga 5 de velocidad de objetos adicional por dada asesinato o asistencia de cada campe\u00f3n que consigas por primera vez. Se acumula hasta 5 veces.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 8, "name": "CAZADOR INCESANTE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/T4PyCjRsoN6ancvBJYa0a/55ee275865c878c77032074ef67cbd38/10.png", "short_description": "Los asesinatos otorgan velocidad de movimiento fuera de combate", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga 10 de velocidad de movimiento fuera de combate. Por cada eliminaci\u00f3n de un campe\u00f3n o monstruo \u00e9pico que consigas, otorga 2 de velocidad de movimiento fuera de combate. Se acumula hasta 5 veces.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 9, "name": "GUARDI\u00c1N ZOMBI", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/cWlSVBz2TQl6JsXHSPcpP/2c62a8ddb68f4736dca9a424b7b74731/3.png", "short_description": "Visi\u00f3n y fuerza adaptable", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Destruir un guardi\u00e1n enemigo crea un guardi\u00e1n zombi en su lugar, lo que otorga visi\u00f3n del \u00e1rea circundante durante 120 segundos. Adem\u00e1s, otorga 3 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 6 de poder de habilidad. Se acumula hasta 5 veces. Otorga 10 de da\u00f1o de ataque o 20 poder de habilidad al conseguir 5 acumulaciones.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 3, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}]}, {"id": 4, "key": "resolve", "name": "Resolve", "runes": [{"id": 42, "name": "DEMOLER", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2hk8l4vhux7JGKdxk6pSYi/c463f225442fd4e57a248c9b64a31031/1.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Destruye torretas", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al estar a 5.5 de distancia de una torreta enemiga, obtienes una carga cada 0.5 segundos, hasta un m\u00e1ximo de 6. Con el m\u00e1ximo de cargas, el siguiente ataque b\u00e1sico que asestes a la torreta inflige (", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "100 + 22", "marks": [], "content": []}, {"nodeType": "text", "value": "% de la vida m\u00e1xima)) de da\u00f1o f\u00edsico.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 30 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 41, "name": "FUENTE DE VIDA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/7e5qby6IsoHn1y9T4Xinrn/645aac58dbd6c9b99a4aba78aa9e9475/2.png", "short_description": "Curaci\u00f3n del equipo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": " Golpear a un campe\u00f3n enemigo con ataque o habilidades lo marca. Cuando t\u00fa o tus aliados inflig\u00eds da\u00f1o a los campeones marcados, os cur\u00e1is.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Solo se puede activar este efecto una vez por marca.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "hr"}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n a aliados: 3% de la vida m\u00e1xima de vida + un 15% del poder de habilidad.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Curaci\u00f3n propia: 1% de la vida m\u00e1xima + un 5% del poder de habilidad.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Duraci\u00f3n de la marca: 3 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 15 segundos para campeones cuerpo a cuerpo, 20 segundos para campeones a distancia.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Se reducen un 25% las curaciones consecutivas que provengan de las marcas de otros aliados.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 40, "name": "CORAJE DEL COLOSO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/6dwIgbgQPsCWklfO3f1Mmy/810c8f0231e085b46afb41c5b9cf110e/3.png", "short_description": "Escudo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga un escudo que absorbe de 25 a 45 (dependiendo del nivel) + 1% del da\u00f1o por vida m\u00e1xima durante 3 segundos al inmovilizar a un campe\u00f3n enemigo.\n\nEnfriamiento: 10 segundos.\r", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 39, "name": "INQUEBRANTABLE", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3JlbcAuKdhQQp5aYEH7mkG/243c63f1136094f6040b515a5f300ef9/4.png", "short_description": "Resistencia de armadura y m\u00e1gica", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Obtienes un 5% de armadura y de resistencia m\u00e1gica. Por cada 1 campeones enemigos cercanos, otorga un 4% de armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica adicionales. Si el m\u00e1ximo de campeones enemigos est\u00e1 cerca (m\u00e1ximo: 3), tambi\u00e9n otorga un 20% de resistencia a ralentizaciones.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 0, "col": 3, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 38, "name": "FUERZAS RENOVADAS", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3mptLoh3ZJhRxSSLvQqVMS/14f025ce3c21277c4d8344b271b2671e/5.png", "short_description": "Restaura vida despu\u00e9s de infligir da\u00f1o", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga 5 de vida cada 5 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al recibir da\u00f1o de un campe\u00f3n enemigo, regenera 6 + (un 2% de la vida que te falte) durante 5 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Este efecto se duplica para los campeones cuerpo a cuerpo.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 37, "name": "ORBE ANULADOR", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3Rtq7nXP0YXo15rB3Fp8VT/cadf7c749fe8daa55a64d152b6632bd8/6.png", "short_description": "Resumen: Otorga un escudo al tener poca vida", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Si un campe\u00f3n enemigo te inflige da\u00f1o como para bajar del 35% de tu vida m\u00e1xima, obtienes un escudo durante 4 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Escudo: 60 a 190  (dependiendo del nivel)\r", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Enfriamiento: 60 segundos.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 36, "name": "Revestimiento de huesos", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/1GVg4j9fgzwnK2VR6s44KZ/be42989ea11cff3d248049bf4252f7c1/7.png", "short_description": "Bloquea da\u00f1o de combos", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Al recibir da\u00f1o de un campe\u00f3n, el ataque o habilidad actual y los 3 siguientes ataques o habilidades de campeones que te golpeen en los pr\u00f3ximos 1,5 segundos te infligen 30-60 (depende del nivel) menos de da\u00f1o (30 segundos de enfriamiento).", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 1, "col": 2, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 35, "name": "SOBRECRECIMIENTO", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/ik785Cw2HCVSsIGLd5Bv3/537b644c357546adf5035b820e1b1a08/8.png", "short_description": "Vida adicional", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Cuando muere 2 s\u00fabditos o 1 monstruo(s) cerca, otorga 3 de vida m\u00e1xima de forma permanente. La vida m\u00e1xima puede aumentar de forma indefinida. Otorga un 3% de vida m\u00e1xima adicional al conseguir 30 acumulaciones.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 0, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 34, "name": "REVITALIZAR", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/3K6jtC9txWYCfmwm215kOP/75b239dcc9b30bbc4d70282744cf126b/9.png", "short_description": "Mejora de las curaciones y escudo", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Amplifica un 5% las curaciones y escudos. Si la vida del objetivo es inferior a un 40%, este efecto se amplifica un 10% adicional.", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}]}, "row": 2, "col": 1, "type": {"key": "secondary", "name": "Secondary"}}, {"id": 33, "name": "PERSEVERANCIA", "image_url": "https://images.ctfassets.net/ekkp7rrkr2gn/2oAkBYTIvhDi4AuyMIRdBC/a8185969c625c80d96edf042f15a4b79/10.png", "short_description": "Armadura, resistencia m\u00e1gica y tenacidad.", "long_description": {"nodeType": "document", "content": [{"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value": "Otorga un 10 % de tenacidad. Otorga de 16 a 30 de armadura y resistencia m\u00e1gica (dependiendo del nivel) durante 1,5 segundos cuando te inmovilizan. La duraci\u00f3n se reinicia cuando te inmovilizan m\u00faltiples veces.\n\n", "marks": [], "content": []}], "data": []}, {"nodeType": "paragraph", "content": [{"nodeType": "text", "value"xœì}{SâÊÖ÷WIMÕ®šın¤sÏüˆŠ¢( ÎøœSV'é@4$LxyŞóİßÕêŠû¼{×¹twVÿÖ}­ïÂ—/;Â—ï’/ß…ÿù7|q¢pBÂ	ûúzÀÅœ}û|£{ø&³3ƒìÓäqLàãÿ~¹#ğï—„À]\?Ò»‡xD